@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+---
+id: task-005-cancel-bookings
+type: task
+title: "Cancel bookings"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+# Cancel bookings
+
+`cancel(bookingId, at)` cancels a booking at the instant `at` (ISO-8601 UTC, on the hour) and returns `{ bookingId, refund }`, the refund in euro cents. The school's cancellation policy (task-001) applies: cancelling less than 24 hours before the booking's start (including after it has started) refunds nothing; cancelling 24 hours or more before the start refunds the full total.
+
+A cancelled booking no longer holds its equipment: the item is free again for its period, for `book` and `availability`. A booking can be cancelled only once; `cancel` throws for an unknown booking, an already cancelled one, or an invalid `at`.
